Flodesk Serif is an altered version of JJannon by François Rappo. Flodesk Serif adjusts the x-height of JJannon to fit perfectly with Flodesk Sans in all typesetting situations. Coincidentally, the x-height alteration gives the typeface a contemporary twist and louder visual impression than the original.

