FAQ

How do I create a sales funnel?

You can create a sales funnel using Flodesk Checkout in 3 easy steps:

1. Design a stunning sales page: Choose from one of our optimized templates or link your own sales page to our Checkout Only template.
2. Set up the payment page: Make it easy for visitors to buy from you with a conversion-optimized payment page. Offer an upsell to generate even more revenue or a discount to drive urgency.
3. Deliver instantly: Deliver your digital products or services all in a few clicks. Allow customers to download their purchase right away or link out to your calendar.

How do Flodesk’s sales funnels work?

Flodesk Checkout is our version of sales funnels that turn visitors into buyers by bringing beautiful sales pages, online payments and instant product delivery together—all in one place. You don’t need a website or a complicated setup with other tools to start selling and accepting payments online.

Does Flodesk Checkout integrate with Flodesk Email?

Yes. With Flodesk Checkout, everything is connected from the start so you can automatically add customers to your email list, track revenue generated, and create a consistent experience across your [email marketing](https://flodesk.com/email) and e-commerce.

Does Flodesk charge a platform fee on transactions?

Flodesk does not charge a platform fee on transactions so you can keep your hard-earned money. All you pay are Stripe's local payment processing fees.

Are there sales page templates available?

Yes! We’ve taken everything we’ve learned from selling online to create beautiful sales page templates that will make it easy to get started and look great on any device. No website required and no need to know how to sell.

Can I accept payments online?

Yes, and it’s so easy. Flodesk Checkout is connected to Stripe for secure payments and includes unlimited sales. There are no complicated setups, separate tools or Flodesk platform fees. All you pay are Stripe's local payment processing fees. Plus, offer flexible payment options that drive conversions, including Apple Pay, Google Pay, Klarna, Affirm and Afterpay.

What actions can I show my customers after they purchase?

Flodesk Checkout is designed to give you full flexibility on the delivery action your customers get after purchase, whether it's an instant download, a link to your scheduling page, a thank you message with further instructions or access to content hosted on another page. Your customers will also automatically receive order confirmation receipts.

Does Flodesk Checkout automatically segment my customers?

Yes. You can create or specify which segments contacts get added to based on their purchase behaviors, and trigger automated email [workflows](https://flodesk.com/workflow) to further build your customer relationships.

Can I add an upsell?

Yes. Make even more money by enticing customers with a last-minute bonus offer while they’re checking out.

Are there revenue analytics?

Yes. See how much money you’ve made, your average conversion rate across all checkouts, which checkout is bringing you the most sales and much more.

Is there a free trial available?

Yes! We offer a free trial so you can explore Flodesk Checkout. During your 14‑day free trial, you can publish checkout pages and process payments—just like a paid plan. Once your trial ends, you can still create and edit checkout pages, but you won’t be able to publish them. Any checkout pages you published during the trial will no longer be visible to customers, so they won’t be able to make new purchases.

